    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρᾰφάρμᾰκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compounded of four drugs</i>:—as
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραφάρμακος, ἡ</span>, <i>a compound of wax,
				tallow, pitch, resin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Meno
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				14.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.433
			</span></i> (= <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.154
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.242
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κον, τό</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				12.328
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κος, ἡ</span>,
			metaph., of the first four <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύριαι
			Δόξαι</span> of Epicurus, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1005.4
			</span></i>.</div>
